nd stamp-card rewards at real partner restaurants and cafés. You book a deal in the app, show up and swipe to check in — no coupons or codes to fumble with. Browse what&#x27;s on near you in the BIMM app.</p></details><details class=\"group border-b border-black/10 pb-2\"><summary class=\"cursor-pointer list-none flex justify-between items-center gap-4 py-2 text-[16px] md:text-[17px] font-medium\"><span>Is eating out in Veszprém expensive, and how do I do Veszprém on a budget?</span><span class=\"text-black/40 transition-transform group-open:rotate-45 text-[22px] leading-none\">+</span></summary><p class=\"text-black/65 text-[15px] leading-relaxed pb-2 pr-8\">Yes — Veszprém can be a pricey place to eat out, so a little planning goes a long way. Picking restaurants and cafés that currently have a deal is one honest, practical way to bring the bill down without cooking every meal yourself. BIMM gathers those deals in one place across 1 Veszprém venues, from full 2-for-1 meals to smaller everyday wins like a free coffee on a loyalty card. Open the BIMM app to see which budget-friendly spots are running offers.</p></details><details class=\"group border-b border-black/10 pb-2\"><summary class=\"cursor-pointer list-none flex justify-between items-center gap-4 py-2 text-[16px] md:text-[17px] font-medium\"><span>Are there cheap eats and restaurant deals in Veszprém for tourists?</span><span class=\"text-black/40 transition-transform group-open:rotate-45 text-[22px] leading-none\">+</span></summary><p class=\"text-black/65 text-[15px] leading-relaxed pb-2 pr-8\">Visitors can use BIMM exactly like locals do — the deals are at real partner restaurants and cafés around Veszprém, not tourist-trap gimmicks. You&#x27;ll find 2-for-1 meals, discounts that save a set amount in NOK, free items and gift cards, so it works whether you want a proper dinner out or just an affordable coffee between sights. Some deals run on specific days or within certain time windows, which the app shows you up front. Check the BIMM app when you arrive to see the 0 Veszprém venues with live offers.</p></details><details class=\"group border-b border-black/10 pb-2\"><summary class=\"cursor-pointer list-none flex justify-between items-center gap-4 py-2 text-[16px] md:text-[17px] font-medium\"><span>I&#x27;m planning a trip to Norway on a budget — how do I save on food?</span><span class=\"text-black/40 transition-transform group-open:rotate-45 text-[22px] leading-none\">+</span></summary><p class=\"text-black/65 text-[15px] leading-relaxed pb-2 pr-8\">Food is one of the easier travel costs to trim in Veszprém if you line up deals before you sit down. Before or during your trip you can see which of the 0 venues have offers running, then book in the app and check in with a swipe when you arrive — handy when you&#x27;d rather not fuss with vouchers abroad. Deals range from 2-for-1 meals and free items to gift cards and fixed-amount NOK discounts, and some run only on certain weekdays or evenings. Browse Veszprém deals in the BIMM app as part of your trip planning.</p></details><details class=\"group border-b border-black/10 pb-2\"><summary class=\"cursor-pointer list-none flex justify-between items-center gap-4 py-2 text-[16px] md:text-[17px] font-medium\"><span>Are there 2-for-1 or discount meals in Veszprém?</span><span class=\"text-black/40 transition-transform group-open:rotate-45 text-[22px] leading-none\">+</span></summary><p class=\"text-black/65 text-[15px] leading-relaxed pb-2 pr-8\">Yes. 2-for-1 meals are one of BIMM&#x27;s core deal types, alongside discounts that take a fixed amount off in NOK — for example, a sharing set menu for two where members save 450 NOK. You&#x27;ll also find free items, gift cards and stamp-card loyalty rewards, and some offers apply only on certain evenings or time windows, which the app makes clear. Open the BIMM app to see which of the 1 Veszprém restaurants and cafés have 2-for-1 or discount deals on right now.</p></details><details class=\"group border-b border-black/10 pb-2\"><summary class=\"cursor-pointer list-none flex justify-between items-center gap-4 py-2 text-[16px] md:text-[17px] font-medium\"><span>How does BIMM work?</span><span class=\"text-black/40 transition-transform group-open:rotate-45 text-[22px] leading-none\">+</span></summary><p class=\"text-black/65 text-[15px] leading-relaxed pb-2 pr-8\">BIMM is a subscription app for restaurant and café deals, primarily in Oslo and a few other cities. You browse partner venues, pick a deal — a 2-for-1 meal, a fixed-NOK discount, a free item, a gift card or stamp-card loyalty like every 5th coffee free — book it for a time that suits you, then show up and swipe to check in — no coupons or codes. Stamp cards reward repeat visits, for instance every 8th tea at 95% off. Open the BIMM app to browse the deals near you.</p></details></div></section><nav aria-label=\"Other cities\" class=\"mt-12 pt-8 border-t border-black/10\"><h2 class=\"text-[15px] font-bold uppercase tracking-wide text-black/50 mb-3\">Deals in other cities</h2><ul class=\"flex flex-wrap gap-x-5 gap-y-2 text-[15px]\"><li><a class=\"underline hover:no-underline\" href=\"/deals/oslo\">Oslo</a></li><li><a class=\"underline hover:no-underline\" href=\"/deals/lillestrom\">Lillestrøm</a></li><li><a class=\"underline hover:no-underline\" href=\"/deals/moss\">Moss</a></li><li><a class=\"underline hover:no-underline\" href=\"/deals/sandvika\">Sandvika</a></li><li><a class=\"underline hover:no-underline\" href=\"/deals/tromso\">Tromsø</a></li><li><a class=\"underline hover:no-underline\" href=\"/deals/budapest\">Budapest</a></li><li><a class=\"underline hover:no-underline\" href=\"/deals/sandefjord\">Sandefjord</a></li><li><a class=\"underline hover:no-underline\" href=\"/deals/budaors\">Budaörs</a></li><li><a class=\"underline hover:no-underline\" href=\"/deals/drammen\">Drammen</a></li><li><a class=\"underline hover:no-underline\" href=\"/deals/vestby\">Vestby</a></li></ul></na